      en: ["Elevation: 1,200 m.", "Daily vehicles: 1,000.", "Annual passengers: 400,000.", "Opened year: 1990 (reconstructed 2010).", "Distance to Tbilisi: 150 km.", "Annual cargo volume: 500,000 tonnes."],
